# Project Development Guide

> This project uses Invar for verifiable AI-assisted development.

---

## Session Start (REQUIRED)

Every session, before any code changes:

```
1. Read INVAR.md (protocol rules)
2. Read .invar/context.md (current state, recent decisions)
3. Run: invar guard --changed (baseline check)
```

---

## Verification (REQUIRED)

After ANY code change, before considering the task complete:

```bash
invar guard --changed    # Architecture check - MUST PASS
pytest --doctest-modules # Logic check - MUST PASS
```

**Do NOT skip verification. Do NOT use `git commit --no-verify`.**

If Guard fails:
1. Read the violation message and suggestion
2. Fix the issue
3. Re-run Guard
4. Repeat until pass

