## When to Use Exploration Tools

| Situation | Command | What You Get |
|-----------|---------|--------------|
| First time seeing a file | `invar sig <file>` | All function signatures without reading code |
| Need to find where X is defined | `invar map` | Symbol locations across project |
| Understanding high-traffic code | `invar map --top 20` | Most-referenced symbols |
| Before modifying unfamiliar code | `invar sig <file>::<function>` | Specific function with contracts |

